note A press against last frame's hit: a button sends its action (preview, callees, callers, context) or defers a GoTo for listing; a header click grabs the node, defers selecting its step (or focusing its symbol off the path) and sends HoldLook so the camera stays put; a press on a code line grabs the node and, with ctrl or alt, defers a definition jump or peek at the column under the pointer; a body press grabs the node; the background starts a pan.

